        "body_raw": "Magic fang gives one natural weapon or unarmed strike of the subject a +1 enhancement bonus on attack and damage rolls. The spell can affect a slam attack, fist, bite, or other natural weapon. The spell does not change an unarmed strike's damage from nonlethal damage to lethal damage.\n\nMagic fang can be made permanent with a permanency spell.Mythic Magic FangSource Mythic Adventures pg. 100\nThe spell affects an additional number of the target’s natural weapons equal to your tier. For example, if you’re 3rd tier, it could affect two claws and one bite)."
